# CLUE ITEMS (MAPS' random clue spots, CLUE_SYSTEM_DESIGN: every spot rolls nothing / decoy / trace / evidence /
# payoff each time a map opens). The maps' randomizedItems name these; without them a map with clue spots
# will not load. Decoys stay on the map; the rest come home. STAND-IN: they come home and count toward
# nothing yet - which lead each kind feeds, and how much, is the clue system's job (LEDGER, 12 Nov).

items:
  - type: STR_CLUE_DECOY_CARGO
    size: 0.1
    weight: 1
    bigSprite: 100
    floorSprite: 100
    invWidth: 1
    invHeight: 1
    battleType: 0
    recover: false
    costSell: 0
  - type: STR_CLUE_CARGO_TRACE
    size: 0.1
    weight: 1
